  "raw_text": "I may not get it. But any deals on Big Macs, I'm there. Agent: Thank you for that insight. Over the past two weeks, what have been your most common fast-food patterns? This includes when you eat it, what you usually order, and what... User: The past two weeks, all I get is a Big Mac meal. If I'm feeling extra spicy, I might get two Big Macs for only one meal and then one sandwich. Agent: Thank you. What does \"good value\" mean to you in fast food? Could you pick your top two or three... User: Good value is anything from McDonald's because it tastes delicious and is relatively affordable so anything from McDonald's is good value. Agent: I understand that for you, anything from McDonald's represents good value because of its taste and affordability. From the options of taste, portion size, speed, nutrition, consistency, and price, could you pick your top two or three factors that define \"good value\" for you, and explain how you judge if something is \"worth it\" based on those? User: If it",
